    {
      "source": "A simple <a href=\"../../interceptor/CacheResolver.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.cache.interceptor\"><code>CacheResolver</code></a> that resolves the exception cache\nbased on a configurable <a href=\"../../CacheManager.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.cache\"><code>CacheManager</code></a> and the name of the\ncache: <code>CacheResultOperation.getExceptionCacheName()</code>.",
      "translation": "一个简单的<a href=\"../../interceptor/CacheResolver.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.cache.interceptor\"><code>CacheResolver</code></a>，它根据可配置的<a href=\"../../CacheManager.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.cache\"><code>CacheManager</code></a>和缓存名称（即：<code>CacheResultOperation.getExceptionCacheName()</code>）来解析异常缓存。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Provide the name of the cache(s) to resolve against the current cache manager.",
      "translation": "提供缓存名称以解析当前缓存管理器。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>context</code> - the context of the particular invocation",
      "translation": "<code>context</code> - 特定调用的上下文",
